TITLE Barite SI vs temperature steps
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mg/L
    Ba 2.0
    S(6) 15.0
    -water 1
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    25 95 in 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file barite_sel.tsv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp SI_Barite
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, SI("Barite")
END
